<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Hike planner" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
  <metadata>
    <name>Mailbox Peak, New Trail</name>
    <desc>Mailbox Peak trailhead to the summit and back by the New Trail. 15.9 km, +1,219 m, −1,219 m.</desc>
  </metadata>
  <wpt lat="47.466015" lon="-121.672618">
    <ele>267.0</ele>
    <name>1 Trailhead</name>
    <desc>Discover Pass on the dashboard. Carry all your water: 2 L each, there is no reliable source on the trail. Headlamp in the pack, whatever the plan says.</desc>
    <sym>Flag, Blue</sym>
    <type>Milestone</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="47.465489" lon="-121.660339">
    <ele>597.7</ele>
    <name>2 Switchbacks, 600 m</name>
    <desc>Steady grade in tall forest. Settle into a pace you could hold all day; this is a quarter of the climb.</desc>
    <sym>Flag, Blue</sym>
    <type>Milestone</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="47.462730" lon="-121.656569">
    <ele>870.2</ele>
    <name>3 Halfway up, 870 m</name>
    <desc>Half the height is done. Eat something now, not at the top.</desc>
    <sym>Flag, Blue</sym>
    <type>Milestone</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="47.462409" lon="-121.647331">
    <ele>1220.4</ele>
    <name>4 Old Trail junction</name>
    <desc>The trails merge for the last 0.8 km and 250 m. Trees thin out, then the boulder field: steep and rocky, with built steps. Layer up before it, not on it.</desc>
    <sym>Flag, Blue</sym>
    <type>Milestone</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="47.462409" lon="-121.639280">
    <ele>1474.0</ele>
    <name>5 Summit, the mailbox</name>
    <desc>Sign the register in the mailbox. Rainier is to the south on a clear day. Dry layer and shell on before you sit down; wind is the norm here.</desc>
    <sym>Flag, Blue</sym>
    <type>Milestone</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="47.462409" lon="-121.647331">
    <ele>1220.4</ele>
    <name>6 Old Trail junction (down)</name>
    <desc>Keep LEFT onto the New Trail. The Old Trail drops straight down the ridge; it is 4 km shorter but brutal on knees.</desc>
    <sym>Flag, Blue</sym>
    <type>Milestone</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="47.462730" lon="-121.656569">
    <ele>870.2</ele>
    <name>7 Halfway down, 870 m</name>
    <desc>Half the descent done. Quick stop; legs stay warmer moving.</desc>
    <sym>Flag, Blue</sym>
    <type>Milestone</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="47.466015" lon="-121.672618">
    <ele>267.0</ele>
    <name>8 Trailhead</name>
    <desc>Finish. Back at the car.</desc>
    <sym>Flag, Blue</sym>
    <type>Milestone</type>
  </wpt>
  <trk>
    <name>Mailbox Peak, New Trail</name>
